# UNDERDELVE: in the key room, climbing the four ladders in the order carved
# on the tablet (read back to front) brings out the chest with the brass key.
# A wrong ladder starts the sequence over.
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 5
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 3 4 150 130
wait 10
expect key_solved == 0
cheat pos 211 130
hold UP 140
expect key_step == 1
cheat pos 115 130
hold UP 140
expect key_step == 0
cheat pos 211 130
hold UP 140
cheat pos 51 130
hold UP 140
cheat pos 275 130
hold UP 140
cheat pos 115 130
hold UP 140
expect key_step == 4
expect key_solved == 1
cheat pos 30 130
wait 20
press LEFT 1
press B
wait 20
expect items & 16
